    "description": "Native van Genuchten retention parameters (alpha [1/m], n) and saturated hydraulic conductivity for the 12 USDA texture classes, from Carsel and Parrish (1988) Table 3 (alpha converted from 1/cm, K_sat from cm/h). Dry volumetric heat capacities (ci) are texture-class values carried over from the bundled clapp-hornberger dataset ('silt' uses the silty_loam value). Intended for the 'van-genuchten' soil model; the Campbell and Brooks-Corey models reject these types because no measured 'b' exponent exists."
